In the word file, the closing quote mark is not a regular ' but is a 'smart quote' - ’ (and you have to look *very* closely to see the difference). If that's what you are running in R, that might be the source of the error. But it might be that Word has changed the quote after you pasted it. It's better to send code in text files, because of that issue.

