> error in evaluating the argument 'object' in selecting a method for function 'summary': Error:
> object 'fit' not found

The error says you tried to get a summary from "fit" before you created "fit".  Same problem when you run inspect(fit, "cov.lv <http://cov.lv>") -- it looks like your lavaan object is "fit1", not "fit".

